  "problem": "Determine the number of pivot columns of the matrix $B,$ given by\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -4 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$",
